    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6543" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναθέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δένδρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					5.54
				</span></i>
			, etc.: c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀνάντη</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				13.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of plants,
				<i>shoot up,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὀμιχλῶδες . . ἀναθέον εἰς ὕψος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(2).178
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>run up, rise,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				60c
			</span></i>.</div>
